# Merged by config.sh over bcm2712_defconfig and uconsole.config, for the
# CM5. 4K pages, as the CM4, not the 16K of bcm2712_defconfig: the
# packages of the builder are made under qemu with 4K pages, and
# jemalloc, 32-bit programs and some JITs need them
# (notes/gentoo-image.md, decision 6). uconsole-cm5-16k.config is the
# same kernel with the 16K pages (USE cm5-16k).
CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-uconsole-cm5"
CONFIG_ARM64_4K_PAGES=y
# CONFIG_ARM64_16K_PAGES is not set
